    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335e30310d3b26561dfb59b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（春）”为属于长途跑者的顶尖决定战。\n虽说樱花桂冠的确拥有长距离资质──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3080b26b2778f3e517c6291a3bf565b8a9c6b11de55598f73ad9a93962a09bbc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51480d5425a9a9297142f13e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实况",
      "source_fingerprint": "50349a592c466fb97eeafeb81fd3fa65c8c3b2e779463937300c4c8f97230140",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c13889adf85a72b77efbe3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真是场令人屏息的攻防战！\n称霸“菊花赏”的是樱花桂冠！\n冠军是樱花桂冠！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c6a9ea3f886c28c8bd6d710d2e39738e1fc96089600500aaca3459b4e916b89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1076/storytimeline_501076315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
