    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a76849a31dc7efb3bca73bc8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "光决定参赛是很单纯，但要是决定后，\n身体却无法容许我进行实现目标所须的训练，\n那即使赶在现在参赛也毫无意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edda463bd5d2ee4e5ecc9c3ef8d3531948560d90b8cc0e5009a092f7ccd5eb64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
